                                    execution_context: Mapping[str, Any] | None = None) -> dict[str, Any]:
        """Persist a bounded daily US-to-HK projection from the injected owner.

        The builder runs in a single non-queueing read lane; only this caller
        can publish its accepted result. A timed-out reader can never write.
        """
        from .us_mapping_research import persist_daily_run
        return persist_daily_run(self, target_trade_date, now=now,
            timeout_seconds=timeout_seconds, execution_context=execution_context)

